==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 4~13.33 seconds<sup>120f~400f</sup>.
**6 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Treat this stage as just a slightly souped-up version of [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]], so you can use basically the same strategy here. Depending on when you encounter this stage, you will have stronger units to blow up Teacher Bun Bun with.

